  "ruleText": "Plc 906.05 Continuing Education Required. Each licensee shall complete 12 hours of continuing education during each licensing period, as required by RSA 328-B:4, VII(j).\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
